      <p>Dynamic Provisioning allows you to create storage volumes on-demand, eliminating the need for cluster administrators to pre-provision storage. For more information about dynamic provisioning, see <a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/storage/dynamic-provisioning#dynamic-provisioning">Dynamic provisioning</a>.</p>
